    },
    {
      "subject": "Father Ferapont",
      "relation": "QUARRELS_WITH",
      "object": "Father Païssy",
      "quote": "“I’ve come here to drive out your visitors, the unclean devils. I’ve come to see how many have gathered here while I have been away. I want to sweep them out with a birch broom.”",
